cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this curriculum or its modules in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Pixels2GenAI: A Progressive Creative Coding Curriculum from Computational Foundations to Generative AI"
abstract: >-
  Pixels2GenAI is a fifteen-module open-source curriculum that scaffolds learners
  from NumPy array manipulation through pixel operations, geometry, fractals,
  simulation, classical machine learning, neural networks, real-time integration,
  and generative AI models. Modules alternate between two pedagogical formats:
  Hands-On Discovery (runnable sketch first, theory after) and Conceptual Deep-Dive
  (formalism first). The curriculum was empirically evaluated in a one-day workshop
  (n = 9) as part of an MSc thesis at SRH Berlin University of Applied Sciences.
